title: A District Acts Alone
subtitle: The Zentrale's line is not being followed.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: defiance_flag = 1
frequency: 50
on-arrival: {!
Q.defiance_target = Q.defiant_district;
Q.defiance_target_faction = Q['district_' + Q.defiant_district + '_faction'];
Q.defiance_flag = 0;
!}

= A District Acts Alone

The district of **[+ defiant_district_name +]**, led by the [+ defiant_faction_name +], has called its own armed demonstrations without asking the Zentrale. The police are already moving in.

- @back: Back them publicly.
- @disown: Disown the action.
- @delegation: Send a delegation from the Zentrale.

@back
subtitle: The district is grateful; the line is weakened.
on-arrival: {!
Q.militancy += 8;
Q.repression += 6;
Q['district_' + Q.defiance_target + '_loyalty'] += 10;
Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 5;
Q.unity -= 3;
!}

The Zentrale declares its solidarity. The district leaders take note: defiance pays.

@disown
subtitle: The line holds; the district and its faction are furious.
on-arrival: {!
Q['district_' + Q.defiance_target + '_loyalty'] -= 10;
Q[Q.defiance_target_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
Q.spd_relation += 2;
!}

The Zentrale declares the action unauthorised. The district calls it a stab in the back.

@delegation
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Calms things down.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q['district_' + Q.defiance_target + '_loyalty'] += 5;
Q.militancy -= 3;
!}

The delegation persuades the district to call off the action, this time.
